{"year":"2023","content":[{"type":"text","content_text":"The 76th Cannes Film Festival took place from May 16 to 27, 2023, with Sweden's <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 56370, 'screen_type': person}\">Ruben Östlund</a>, the previous year's Palme winner, as jury president. With <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 915935, 'screen_type': movie}\">Anatomie d'une chute</a> (Anatomy of a Fall, 2023), <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 1175620, 'screen_type': person}\">Justine Triet</a> became the third woman to win the Palme d'Or, after Jane Campion (1993) and Julia Ducournau (2021). <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 467244, 'screen_type': movie}\">The Zone of Interest</a> (2023), by <a href=\"https://_{type: 'screen', 'id': 66728, 'screen_type': person}\">Jonathan Glazer</a>, took the Grand Prix. The festival opened with Maïwenn's <i>Jeanne du Barry</i> and presented honorary Palmes d'Or to Michael Douglas and Harrison Ford."},{"type":"person_list","title":"The Jury","persons":[{"id":56370,"name":"Ruben Östlund","profile_path":"/4guO74SMutkaozyYFMvctFPf2jm.jpg"},{"id":17142,"name":"Paul Dano","profile_path":"/gOD5bO0hKnzzJm7sJeGeEJjfBBw.jpg"},{"id":1392433,"name":"Julia Ducournau","profile_path":"/3shIDLkYLA5xIdfwXbxr8B2FMVT.jpg"},{"id":60073,"name":"Brie Larson","profile_path":"/iqZ5uKJWbwSITCK4CqdlUHZTnXD.jpg"},{"id":81125,"name":"Denis Ménochet","profile_path":"/qpCPmm12kbzMKniYF6iKmKLZCjY.jpg"},{"id":557100,"name":"Rungano Nyoni","profile_path":"/wliVrt4xI7iLMUxJxVEz97FPPeI.jpg"},{"id":28671,"name":"Atiq Rahimi","profile_path":"/qF0KrBwZkPLjAqLHk3Hu40zdBFm.jpg"},{"id":591600,"name":"Damián Szifron","profile_path":"/zCC1SUcjoDuJui9qgFjJIgr6kDq.jpg"},{"id":1680263,"name":"Maryam Touzani","profile_path":"/pZzjavB0zLgm9sHxki70BDmlwpT.jpg"}]},{"type":"awards_nominees","name":"Palme d'Or","nominee_list":[{"type":"movie","id":915935,"name":"Anatomy of a Fall","image_path":"/woXYl0DJTx6TsfYWPkSfNHTsoOx.jpg","director":"Justine Triet","winner":t